 the headphones  make sure they're not in your ears when  you test this feature out because it is  quite loud and I think it's about a  hundred decibels which you're going to  be able to hear if you're just looking  around for these headphones so props the  Samsung for throwing that feature in and  making sure we don't all lose these tiny  little headphones and that's all I have  for you guys today on the samsung galaxy  buds if I've missed anything let me know  in the comments down below a little bit  of an apology again for being sick but  as always make sure you smash that  subscribe button  20-19 style and I'll see you next Monday  you

